<title>FRANCE: Synthelabo nine month sales up 10.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Synthelabo nine month sales up 10.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 7,582.1  up  10.4 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Synthelabo said in a financial advertisement that on a like-for-like basis sales were up 11 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
